  "steps": [
    "Grind the coconut, garlic and half the onion to a paste with a little water.",
    "Heat the coconut oil and fry the remaining onion until golden.",
    "Add the Malvani masala and turmeric and fry for 30 seconds, then add the ground paste and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the water, kokum and salt and bring to a boil, then simmer for 8 minutes.",
    "Add the fish, cover and cook gently for 8 minutes without stirring vigorously.",
    "Finish with the coriander leaves and rest 10 minutes before serving."
  ]
